+# The Daily Grind
+
+Homepage plus passkey-based customer accounts (the "My Account" dialog).
+
+```sh
+pnpm install
+pnpm start            # http://localhost:11222
+```
+
+| Variable         | Default                     | Purpose                                         |
+| ---------------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
+| `PORT`           | `11222`                     | Listen port                                     |
+| `RP_ID`          | `localhost`                 | WebAuthn Relying Party ID (your domain)         |
+| `ORIGIN`         | `http://localhost:$PORT`    | Comma-separated allowed origins (use `https://` in production) |
+| `SESSION_SECRET` | random per boot             | Session cookie signing secret                   |
+| `DATA_FILE`      | `./data/db.json`            | JSON store for accounts and passkeys            |
+
+Passkeys require a secure context: `https://` in production, or `http://localhost` locally.
